title: 'pallet-proxy: add try_state invariant checks'

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    In the new `try_state` hook, several storage invariants for the pallet are checked,
    with consideration for future use as an oracle in pallet fuzzing campaigns. The two
    deposit-amount checks warn by default and become hard errors under a new `fuzzing`
    feature. Unit tests were added to validate the checks.

crates:
- name: pallet-proxy
  bump: minor
